      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/919ad9/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-03T21:06:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If this has been answered I could not find it, and apologize for reposting.&nbsp;</p><p>Last night we were playing with Legacy, Fanatic, The Naturalist, and Haka.&nbsp; Legacy had his Galvanize out so there was an Damage Dealt +1 on all the heroes.&nbsp; Fanatic then used Sacrosanct Martyr.&nbsp;</p><p>Power: Fanatic deals herself up to 5 radiant damage.&nbsp; Fanatic deals 1 target x radiant damage, where x= the amount of radiant damage dealt to Fanatic this turn.</p><p>If I dealt Fanatic 5 damage, would that then become 6 due to the Galvanize?&nbsp; And then would the damage dealt to the target become 7 because it says \"Fanatic deals\"?&nbsp; Or am I over thinking it and she deals herself 5 damage and puts out 6?&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you in advance.&nbsp; Sorry for the absurdity of the question.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>revpain.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:00.825Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
