      "raw": "<p>If this has been answered I could not find it, and apologize for reposting.&nbsp;</p><p>Last night we were playing with Legacy, Fanatic, The Naturalist, and Haka.&nbsp; Legacy had his Galvanize out so there was an Damage Dealt +1 on all the heroes.&nbsp; Fanatic then used Sacrosanct Martyr.&nbsp;</p><p>Power: Fanatic deals herself up to 5 radiant damage.&nbsp; Fanatic deals 1 target x radiant damage, where x= the amount of radiant damage dealt to Fanatic this turn.</p><p>If I dealt Fanatic 5 damage, would that then become 6 due to the Galvanize?&nbsp; And then would the damage dealt to the target become 7 because it says &quot;Fanatic deals&quot;?&nbsp; Or am I over thinking it and she deals herself 5 damage and puts out 6?&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you in advance.&nbsp; Sorry for the absurdity of the question.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>revpain.</p>",
