      "created_at": "2014-08-04T10:24:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think about the only time you <span class=\"bbcode-i\">don't</span> get to apply a buff twice in the same power is with Mr Fixer's Dual Crowbars, where it specifies that the second hit has to be the same damage as the first, so it doesn't get buffed again.</p>",
